  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCDT - BOLD Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BOLD Project aims to enhance the capacity of national genebanks in managing and using crop diversity for sustainable opportunities, livelihoods and development. Phase 2 will build on the success of Phase 1 by continuing to strengthen genebanks, expanding pre-breeding partnerships, and increasing genebank participation in seed systems and agri-food chains. A key focus will be on nutritious and currently underutilized &quot;opportunity&#x201D; crops, with the goal of improving climate resilience and enhancing nutrition security for local communities. These efforts will expand farmers&apos; access to crop diversity and strengthen food system resilience in partner countries</narrative>
  </description>
